  "notes": "ご{覧|らん}になる is the honorific form of ⟦{見|み}る→見る：00283_miru⟧ (to see/look), used to elevate the listener.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ご覧になる\n\nKEIGO SYSTEM:\n- Honorific: ご{覧|らん}になる (elevates listener)\n- Humble: ⟦{拝見|はいけん}する→拝見する：01823_haikensuru⟧ (lowers speaker)\n- Neutral: ⟦{見|み}る→見る：00283_miru⟧\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦どうぞ→どうぞ：02920_douzo⟧⟦ご{覧|らん}→ご覧：01408_goran⟧⟦ください→ください：02899_kudasai⟧: Please take a look\n- ⟦ご{覧|らん}→ご覧：01408_goran⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{通|とお}り→通り：01475_toori⟧: As you can see\n- ⟦{新聞|しんぶん}→新聞：01440_shinbun⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ご{覧|らん}になる: to read the newspaper (honorific)",
